<description>&lt;p&gt;Sudan General Al-Atta says Puntland mercenaries are fighting alongside RSF, while intense clashes continue in Malakal and an ambush on a Warrap road killed five people. A police officer apologized after a viral video of a Juba assault, claiming the victim was a gang member, and the deputy minister of ICT warned against abusing freedom of expression. Communal violence persists, with a school girl killed by an unintentional RPG explosion in Yei and a cleric shot dead in Juba, while peace talks were launched in Tonj East to end deadly communal violence. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPRllzRGpWWE1oZkJFbmZrZVFJSVFjT3RBN2w1QVREOVZpYzU4ZzREWUNSbjl6ejZ4RHlicDlaSG5BdU1OTGhWeEtNbUdPTFpwTGhsZm1HbFBCcWQxcXJGMTVUZ19KVmpudmtSdDN5dlN0aXR3SU1jMUp0X09rTkVnLWlNeTl5YlZibEQ0cXRSUVhPQ0lzV3dwbDNRRHpOeUJodlo4Z3ZnSXBpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawan Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
